Package: biblioCNKI
Type: Package
Title: Bibliometric Analysis Toolkit for CNKI Chinese Literature Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhang", "Kai", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "kai@example.com"),
    person("Xu", "Yang", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides functions to clean, process and visualize citation data downloaded from CNKI. Includes a Shiny app for cumulative trends, keyword dumbbell plots, institutional heatmaps via Amap geocoding, and AI Chinese word segmentation (DeepSeek or local LLM). No translation needed – fully focused on Chinese literature.
